### Page contents (summary)

| Section | Content |
|--------|---------|
| **Purpose** | Color must not be the only cue for charts, `.ks-swatch` tokens, and encoded tables; ties to `colorOnlyReport` / `MIN_COLOR_LABEL_CHARS` (2). |
| **Passing** | `.ks-swatch-label`, donut legend rows (`.lenses-overview-donut-swatch` + name + `%`), text/`aria-label` in cells, SVG `<title>`. |
| **Failing** | Missing labels (`ks-swatch-missing-label` major), bare legend swatches (`legend-swatch-without-label` warn), color-only `<td>` (`table-cell-color-only` warn). |
| **Before** | `Tkn` swatches without labels, `Dcs` legend swatches only, status table with background-only cells. |
| **After** | Token swatches with labels, `forge-data-charts.js`-style legend rows, `text-success`/`text-danger` status text + `aria-describedby` on chart mount. |
| **Evidence** | `colorOnlyReport`, `color_only_encoding`, remediation steps in generators/templates. |
| **Related** | `DET.CHART.ALT_SUMMARY`, `DET.DATA.TABLE_HEADERS`, `AI.DATA.INSIGHT_LEGIBILITY`, `AI.VISUAL.PRODUCT_EXPLANATORY_VALUE`, `DET.DIAGRAM.ALT` |

